      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَاخِمٌ</span></b>  <i>Conterminous</i> to a land (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِأَرْضٍ</span>). (Mgh.)
You say also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مُتَاخِمِى</span> <i>He is my neighbour,
his house,</i> or <i>tent, adjoining mine.</i> (TA in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جمد </span>.)

